{"text": "Morning, this is the last review before launch, so let's be straightforward about where we are. I have to start with a miss. The data migration did not finish on the 9th, the old supplier records had duplicates and the cleanup took longer than planned. How much longer do you need? Two weeks. I can finish by the 23rd of October. Okay, data migration is now due on October 23rd, same owner. If migration finishes on the 23rd, then 26 October is unrealistic. Nobody can train on data that is not there. Agreed, we have to move GoLive, let's say November 9th. The 9th of November works for me, that gives us over 2 weeks of testing after migration. Then the go live date is now November 9, 2026. That also affects training. It was due on 16 October, but nobody can train on a system that is not ready. Right, I will move training to November 3rd so staff are trained a week before go live, I stay the owner. Good news on security. The review of BetaCloud is finished and they passed. Excellent. Security review is done. On the budget, I checked again, the pilot is still 2x80,000 ringit. Good, so no change to the budget. One more thing, Aisha will be traveling in the first week of November. Maybe I should cover the training for her. That is kind, Raj, but let's see how my calendar looks. I will keep it for now. Should we plan a lessons learned session after go live? Yes, but we will plan it later. Thank you everyone. See you after the launch.", "sentences": [[[" Mor", 0.16, 0.4], ["ning", 0.4, 0.56], [",", 0.56, 0.7200000000000001], [" this", 0.72, 0.88], [" is", 0.8799999999999999, 1.0399999999999998], [" the", 1.04, 1.28], [" last", 1.28, 1.52], [" re", 1.52, 1.6], ["vie", 1.6, 1.76], ["w", 1.7599999999999998, 1.9199999999999997], [" be", 1.92, 2.0], ["for", 2.0, 2.16], ["e", 2.16, 2.3200000000000003], [" la", 2.3200000000000003, 2.4000000000000004], ["un", 2.4, 2.56], ["ch", 2.56, 2.72], [",", 2.72, 2.8800000000000003], [" so", 2.88, 3.12], [" let", 3.12, 3.28000000000000